298 - I Lay My Sins on Jesus
 / 
Key: F
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 298
Topic: Gospel - 

Verse 1:
[F]I lay my [Am]sins [C7]on [A7]Je[Dm]sus,
[Gm7]The [C7]spotless [F]Lamb [Bb]of [Csus]God;[C]
[F7]He bears them [Gm7]all, [F7]and [Bb]frees [Gdim]us
[F]From the ac[C7]cursed [Am7]load[Dm],
[Gm7]From the ac[C7]cursed [F]load.

Verse 2:
[F]I [Am]bring [C7]my [A7]guilt [Dm]to Jesus,
[Gm7][C7]To [F]wash [Bb]my [Csus]crimson [C]stains
[F7]White [Gm7]in [F7]His [Bb]blood [Gdim]most precious,
[F]Till [C7]not [Am7]a [Dm]stain remains,
[Gm7]Till [C7]not a [F]stain remains.

Verse 3:
[F]I [Am]lay [C7]my [A7]wants [Dm]on Jesus,
[Gm7][C7]All [F]fullness [Bb]dwells [Csus]in [C]Him;
[F7][Gm7]He [F7]healeth [Bb]my [Gdim]diseases,
[F]He [C7]doth [Am7]my [Dm]soul redeem,
[Gm7]He [C7]doth my [F]soul redeem.

Verse 4:
[F]I [Am]long [C7]to [A7]be [Dm]like Jesus,
[Gm7][C7]Meek [F]loving, [Bb][Csus]lowly, [C]mild;
[F7]I [Gm7]long [F7]to [Bb]be [Gdim]like Jesus,
[F]The [C7]Father's [Am7]holy [Dm]child,
[Gm7]The [C7]Father's [F]holy child.

Verse 5:
[F]I [Am]long [C7]to [A7]be [Dm]with Jesus
[Gm7][C7]Amid [F]the [Bb][Csus]heav'nly [C]throng,
[F7]To [Gm7]sing [F7]with [Bb]them [Gdim]His praises,
[F]And [C7]learn [Am7]the [Dm]angels'song,
[Gm7]And [C7]learn [F]the angels'song.
